# gig-server — the host gig's throwaway CI VMs run on (heavy-duty/gig#3).
# HOST="yes": rig's delegation installs box and runs its host setup, which
# install.sh needs for `box grant --service gig`. ROOT_DOOR and JOIN match
# runner-server: a fleet machine with automation on its root door, joined by
# pre-auth key (#36).
ROOT_DOOR="open"
HOST="yes"
JOIN="authkey"
